# Changelog

All notable changes to this project will be documented in this file.

The latest version is always available by pulling the `latest` tag.

The format is based on [Keep a Changelog](https://keepachangelog.com/en/1.1.0/),
and this project adheres to [Semantic Versioning](https://semver.org/spec/v2.0.0.html).

## [v1.2.1] - 2026-03-07

Patch release with build and packaging fixes identified during v1.2.0 code review.

### Fixed

- References to retired `stable` Docker tag updated to `latest` across all documentation
- Docker image now uses non-editable `pip install` for a cleaner production build
- Trailing newline added to `docker-compose.yaml` for POSIX compliance

### Changed

- CI workflow gates the `latest` Docker tag to non-prerelease semver versions only

